(cc) the DTMC must be a South African tax resident, be
incorporated in South Africa and have its place of effective
management in South Africa;

(aa) the DTMC must register with the Financial Surveillance
Department;
(bb) at the time of registration, the following information must be
furnished to the Financial Surveillance Department:
(1) the name(s) of the offshore target company(ies);
(2) description of what type of business the DTMC will be
involved in;
(3) jurisdictions in which the offshore companies are
operating in;
(4) details of the envisaged investment;
(5) the percentage equity interest and voting rights acquired
in the foreign target entity; and
(6) overview of the treasury management operations.
